If you expected little, then I'm disappointed you went this way.

I personally hate eBay, and you are showing signs of behavior that is 
just why I hate eBay.

The assumption being that people should pay money, or else I'll toss it. 
It's like trying to blackmail.

Either you go with the hobbyist crowd, and try to be nice, friendly and 
helpful. That means ignore eBay if at all possible, and share knowledge, 
hardware, and whatever with likeminded people. Everyone in the group 
gains, and the nitwits can keep eBay.

Or else start trying to make money of things, and most hobbyist will 
ignore you.

>>                                    But it's always chancy with these
