Most of my systems are VAXstation 4000's (PC sized box) and
AlphaServer 1200's and they
are about twice that size. I don't own bulky equipment and none of it
lives in a 19" rack.
The VAXes are in four stacks: VS4000-60's, VS4000-90'S, microVAX
