There is such a thing as a "half flash" system, which had flash for either
the WNT or SRM consoles, but not both.  At least for the Alphastation
200s, don't know about the PWS 433au, although the "u" means it has the 
SRM. It was a way for DEC to save some money (flash chips) since 99.9%
of the systems would never need both consoles.

Another possibility is the SRM went bad (checksum errors) and perhaps
could be reloaded.


