> I get the addressing working to shift from 0-6 to 8-14.  What is the
> cabling setup to have 2 BA shelves on one controller?

One cable always goes from the controller to the left connector on the 
box (as seen from the front).  The other cable goes from the right 
connector of the first box to the left connector of the second box.  Of 
course, if one is using SE as opposed to LVD, it is difficult to do this 
and stay below the maximum cable length (which of course includes the 
internal path inside the boxes).



